WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:06,910
These three female subordinates all have little combat experience.

2
00:00:06,910 --> 00:00:08,550
Once you meet other awakened people

3
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:09,630
I'm afraid I can't beat him

4
00:00:09,630 --> 00:00:11,270
Even if I can help them practice chess

5
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:13,830
But I can’t do everything myself.

6
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:15,910
