9
00:00:26,410 --> 00:00:28,730
Boss, this is a call from my fiancé.

10
00:00:28,730 --> 00:00:30,250
can i take it

11
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:38,080
Something happened to you

12
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:39,960
Have you found the gunman in your neighborhood?

13
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,480
It's okay Beichen

14
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:42,800
The gunman was found

15
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,440
Anyway, I'm safe now

16
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:46,240
